<h2 dir="auto">Suggested areas to investigate</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Whether the 60s stall watchdog is too aggressive relative to legitimate mid-stream provider-side gaps, or whether it's correctly detecting genuinely dead connections that only occur under concurrent-stream load.</li>
